<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_autoloader">Autoloader</link></para>

<para>This class handles the autoloading of classes within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It registers itself with the SPL autoload stack and loads classes based on naming conventions.</para>

<para>Performance optimizations:<itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Implements class path caching to avoid repeated file_exists() calls</para>
</listitem><listitem>
<para>Caches both successful and failed lookups to prevent redundant checks</para>
</listitem><listitem>
<para>Uses static cache that persists for the entire request lifecycle </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>
Definition at line <link linkend="_class_8autoloader_8php_source_1l00021">21</link> of file <link linkend="_class_8autoloader_8php_source">class.autoloader.php</link>.</para>
</section>
